gantt
  title 示例项目发布计划
  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  axisFormat %m/%d
  excludes weekends
  section 方案与契约
    需求边界确认     :done, scope, 2026-10-05, 3d
    API 契约评审    :done, api, after scope, 3d
    数据迁移设计     :done, schema, after scope, 4d
  section 实现与联调
    服务端实现       :active, backend, after api, 6d
    客户端接入       :active, frontend, after api, 5d
    数据迁移演练     :crit, migration, after schema, 4d
    端到端联调       :crit, integration, after backend, 3d
  section 验证与发布
    性能和故障演练   :perf, after integration, 3d
    安全复核         :security, after integration, 2d
    发布评审         :milestone, review, after perf, 0d
    灰度观察         :crit, canary, after review, 2d
    全量上线         :milestone, launch, after canary, 0d
